{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-34891","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-37808","text":"Agentelic Documentation"}]},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-34893","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37809","marks":["bold"],"text":"Build agents like software. Spec-driven. Tested. Deployed."}]}],"id":"blk-34892","kind":"quote"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-34895","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37810","marks":["bold"],"text":"Part of the [&] Protocol stack"},{"id":"spn-37811","text":" · "},{"id":"spn-37812","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/ECOSYSTEM.md"}],"text":"Ecosystem overview"},{"id":"spn-37813","text":" · "},{"id":"spn-37814","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/PULSE/docs/THREE_PROTOCOL_STACK.md"}],"text":"Three-protocol stack"},{"id":"spn-37815","text":" · "},{"id":"spn-37816","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/STACK_COMPLETION.md"}],"text":"Stack status"}]}],"id":"blk-34894","kind":"quote"},{"id":"blk-34896","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37817","text":"Welcome to the documentation hub for "},{"id":"spn-37818","marks":["bold"],"text":"Agentelic"},{"id":"spn-37819","text":" — a premium, enterprise-grade agent builder that brings software engineering discipline to AI agent development."}]},{"id":"blk-34897","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37820","text":"Agentelic targets the engineering teams that need to ship reliable agents to production — with versioned specs, deterministic testing, staged rollouts, and compliance gates. While the market is flooded with no-code agent builders optimized for demos, Agentelic is optimized for production."}]},{"id":"blk-34898","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37821","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-34899","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-37822","text":"What Agentelic Does"}]},{"id":"blk-34900","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37823","text":"Agentelic is the "},{"id":"spn-37824","marks":["bold"],"text":"engineering layer"},{"id":"spn-37825","text":" of the [&] Protocol ecosystem:"}]},{"id":"blk-34901","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"SpecPrompt (Standards)    → defines agent behavior as versioned specs\n    ↓\nAgentelic (Engineering)   → builds, tests, deploys agents against specs  ← THIS\n    ↓\nOpenSentience (Runtime)   → governs, executes, observes agents locally\n    ↓\nGraphonomous (Memory)     → continual learning knowledge graphs\n    ↓\nFleetPrompt (Distribution) · Delegatic (Orchestration)"},{"id":"blk-34902","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37826","marks":["bold"],"text":"Key capabilities:"}]},{"id":"blk-34903","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-34905","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37827","marks":["bold"],"text":"Spec-driven builds"},{"id":"spn-37828","text":" — Every agent starts from a SpecPrompt specification."}]}],"id":"blk-34904","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-34906","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37829","text":"Parse, generate, compile, and package in one pipeline."}]},{"id":"blk-34907","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-34909","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37830","marks":["bold"],"text":"Deterministic testing"},{"id":"spn-37831","text":" — Tests are derived from acceptance criteria, not"}]}],"id":"blk-34908","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-34910","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37832","text":"hand-written. Mocked tool calls, output validation, regression suites."}]},{"id":"blk-34911","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-34913","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37833","marks":["bold"],"text":"Staged deployment"},{"id":"spn-37834","text":" — Staging → canary → production with permission review"}]}],"id":"blk-34912","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-34914","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37835","text":"gates and compliance checks."}]},{"id":"blk-34915","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-34917","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37836","marks":["bold"],"text":"MCP tool surface"},{"id":"spn-37837","text":" — The entire build pipeline is exposed as MCP tools for"}]}],"id":"blk-34916","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-34918","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37838","text":"AI-assisted agent development."}]},{"id":"blk-34919","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37839","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-34920","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-37840","text":"Documentation Map"}]},{"id":"blk-34921","kind":"code","language":"text","text":":maxdepth: 1\n:caption: Homepages\n\n[&] Ampersand Box <https://ampersandboxdesign.com>\nGraphonomous <https://graphonomous.com>\nBendScript <https://bendscript.com>\nWebHost.Systems <https://webhost.systems>\nAgentelic <https://agentelic.com>\nAgenTroMatic <https://agentromatic.com>\nDelegatic <https://delegatic.com>\nDeliberatic <https://deliberatic.com>\nFleetPrompt <https://fleetprompt.com>\nGeoFleetic <https://geofleetic.com>\nOpenSentience <https://opensentience.org>\nSpecPrompt <https://specprompt.com>\nTickTickClock <https://ticktickclock.com>"},{"id":"blk-34922","kind":"code","language":"text","text":":maxdepth: 1\n:caption: Root Docs\n\n[&] Protocol Docs <https://docs.ampersandboxdesign.com>\nGraphonomous Docs <https://docs.graphonomous.com>\nBendScript Docs <https://docs.bendscript.com>\nWebHost.Systems Docs <https://docs.webhost.systems>\nAgentelic Docs <https://docs.agentelic.com>\nAgenTroMatic Docs <https://docs.agentromatic.com>\nDelegatic Docs <https://docs.delegatic.com>\nDeliberatic Docs <https://docs.deliberatic.com>\nFleetPrompt Docs <https://docs.fleetprompt.com>\nGeoFleetic Docs <https://docs.geofleetic.com>\nOpenSentience Docs <https://docs.opensentience.org>\nSpecPrompt Docs <https://docs.specprompt.com>\nTickTickClock Docs <https://docs.ticktickclock.com>"},{"id":"blk-34923","kind":"code","language":"text","text":":maxdepth: 2\n:caption: Agentelic Docs\n\nspec/README"},{"id":"blk-34924","kind":"paragraph","s